<view class="page">
  <text class="eyebrow">BUCT LAB · 光学</text>
  <text class="title">光谱定性分析</text>
  <text class="subtitle">记录±1级谱线位置。原始读数与θ处理表分别显示，保留3次测量，按实际需要增加测次。</text>
  <view class="card">
    <text class="section-title">实验信息</text>
    <view class="info-grid">
      <label>班级<input value="{{studentClass}}" data-key="studentClass" bindinput="onInfoInput" /></label>
      <label>姓名<input value="{{studentName}}" data-key="studentName" bindinput="onInfoInput" /></label>
      <label>学号<input value="{{studentId}}" data-key="studentId" bindinput="onInfoInput" /></label>
      <label>任课教师<input value="{{teacher}}" data-key="teacher" bindinput="onInfoInput" /></label>
    </view>
    <label class="full-label">谱线名称/颜色<input value="{{lineName}}" data-key="lineName" bindinput="onInfoInput" /></label>
    <text class="hint">原始数据记录必须含指导教师签字；其他记录听从指导教师安排。</text>
  </view>
  <view class="card table-card">
    <text class="section-title">表1 ±1级谱线位置记录表</text>
    <text class="hint">同一谱线重复测量；12:30表示12°30′，12.5表示12.5°。左右滑动查看。</text>
    <scroll-view scroll-x class="table-scroll">
      <view class="table spectral-source">
        <view class="s-row">
          <view class="s-label s-tall">测量次数</view>
          <view class="s-group"><view class="s-group-title">−1级谱线位置</view><view class="s-row"><view class="s-col s-header">左游标读数</view><view class="s-col s-header">右游标读数</view></view></view>
          <view class="s-group"><view class="s-group-title">+1级谱线位置</view><view class="s-row"><view class="s-col s-header">左游标读数</view><view class="s-col s-header">右游标读数</view></view></view>
        </view>
        <view wx:for="{{groups}}" wx:key="id" class="s-row">
          <view class="s-label">{{item.label}}</view>
          <input class="s-col s-input" value="{{item.minusLeft}}" data-index="{{index}}" data-field="minusLeft" bindinput="onReadingInput" placeholder="度:分" maxlength="24" aria-label="第{{item.label}}次负一级左游标" />
          <input class="s-col s-input" value="{{item.minusRight}}" data-index="{{index}}" data-field="minusRight" bindinput="onReadingInput" placeholder="度:分" maxlength="24" aria-label="第{{item.label}}次负一级右游标" />
          <input class="s-col s-input" value="{{item.plusLeft}}" data-index="{{index}}" data-field="plusLeft" bindinput="onReadingInput" placeholder="度:分" maxlength="24" aria-label="第{{item.label}}次正一级左游标" />
          <input class="s-col s-input" value="{{item.plusRight}}" data-index="{{index}}" data-field="plusRight" bindinput="onReadingInput" placeholder="度:分" maxlength="24" aria-label="第{{item.label}}次正一级右游标" />
        </view>
      </view>
    </scroll-view>
    <view class="actions"><button bindtap="onAddGroup" disabled="{{groups.length >= 30}}">增加测次</button><button bindtap="onRemoveGroup" disabled="{{groups.length <= 1}}">删除最后一次</button></view>
    <block wx:for="{{rows}}" wx:key="id"><text wx:if="{{item.error}}" class="error">第{{item.label}}次：{{item.error}}</text><text wx:if="{{item.warning}}" class="warning">第{{item.label}}次：{{item.warning}}</text></block>
  </view>
  <view class="card">
    <text class="section-title">光栅常数与不确定度</text>
    <label class="full-label">光栅刻线密度（条/mm）<input value="{{density}}" data-key="density" bindinput="onInfoInput" placeholder="原件300条/mm" /></label>
    <text class="hint">光栅常数 d=1/{{density || '待填写'}} mm，一级衍射k=1。</text>
    <label class="full-label">光栅常数相对标准不确定度 u(d)/d（%）<input value="{{relativeGratingUncertainty}}" data-key="relativeGratingUncertainty" bindinput="onInfoInput" placeholder="原件0.1%" /></label>
    <label class="full-label">角度仪器标准不确定度 u_B(θ)（rad）<input value="{{angularInstrumentUncertainty}}" data-key="angularInstrumentUncertainty" bindinput="onInfoInput" placeholder="依据仪器及指定课本填写" /></label>
    <text class="hint">填写已换算到衍射角θ的标准不确定度，勿直接填游标误差限。未提供时只显示已知项合成值，不作为完整总不确定度。</text>
    <label class="full-label">参考波长（nm，选填）<input value="{{reference}}" data-key="reference" bindinput="onInfoInput" /></label>
    <text wx:if="{{parameterError}}" class="error">{{parameterError}}</text>
  </view>
  <view class="card table-card">
    <text class="section-title">表2 θ数据处理记录表</text>
    <scroll-view scroll-x class="table-scroll">
      <view class="table spectral-source">
        <view class="s-row"><view class="s-label s-tall">测量次数</view><view class="s-group"><view class="s-group-title">2θ</view><view class="s-row"><view class="s-col s-header">左</view><view class="s-col s-header">右</view></view></view><view class="s-col s-tall s-header">消除偏心差后的2θ</view><view class="s-col s-tall s-header">θ</view></view>
        <view wx:for="{{rows}}" wx:key="id" class="s-row"><view class="s-label">{{item.label}}</view><view class="s-col">{{item.left}}</view><view class="s-col">{{item.right}}</view><view class="s-col">{{item.corrected}}</view><view class="s-col">{{item.theta}}</view></view>
        <view class="s-row"><view class="s-label">平均</view><view class="s-double">—</view><view class="s-col">—</view><view class="s-col">{{result ? result.mean : '—'}}</view></view>
      </view>
    </scroll-view>
  </view>
  <text wx:if="{{message}}" class="notice">{{message}}</text>
  <view wx:if="{{result}}" class="card results">
    <text class="section-title">计算结果</text>
    <text class="hint">n={{result.n}} · p=0.683 · tₚ={{result.tp}}</text>
    <view class="metric"><text>平均衍射角</text><text>{{result.mean}}</text></view>
    <view class="metric"><text>平均衍射角θ（rad）</text><text>{{result.meanRadians}}</text></view>
    <view class="metric"><text>实验方差s²（°²，分母n−1）</text><text>{{result.variance}}</text></view>
    <view class="metric"><text>实验标准差s（°）</text><text>{{result.sd}}</text></view>
    <view class="metric"><text>均值标准差（°）</text><text>{{result.sem}}</text></view>
    <view class="metric"><text>角度A类不确定度（rad）</text><text>{{result.uaRadians}}</text></view>
    <view class="metric"><text>角度合成标准不确定度（rad）</text><text>{{result.thetaUncertainty}}</text></view>
    <view class="metric"><text>波长λ（nm）</text><text>{{result.wavelength}}</text></view>
    <view class="metric"><text>光栅常数贡献（nm）</text><text>{{result.gratingContribution}}</text></view>
    <view class="metric"><text>{{result.complete ? '波长合成标准不确定度（nm）' : '波长不确定度已知项合成值（nm）'}}</text><text>{{result.wavelengthUncertainty}}</text></view>
    <view class="metric"><text>相对参考波长的百分差</text><text>{{result.relativeError}} %</text></view>
    <text wx:if="{{!result.complete}}" class="notice">角度仪器项或A类项尚不完整，当前值不能作为完整总不确定度。</text>
    <text class="hint">按各项独立的条件合成，θ和角度不确定度均以rad传播；计算值供核对，报告最终修约另行处理。</text>
    <button class="primary" bindtap="onCopy" disabled="{{!!parameterError}}">复制原始数据与计算结果</button>
  </view>
  <view class="card">
    <text class="section-title">实验现象与发光元素分析</text>
    <label class="full-label">观察到的实验现象<textarea value="{{observedPhenomenon}}" data-key="observedPhenomenon" bindinput="onInfoInput" placeholder="记录实际谱线颜色、特征等" maxlength="1000" /></label>
    <label class="full-label">结合现象与计算结果分析发光元素<textarea value="{{elementAnalysis}}" data-key="elementAnalysis" bindinput="onInfoInput" placeholder="根据实际观测及波长分析，不只凭单条谱线自动下结论" maxlength="1000" /></label>
  </view>
  <view class="card formulas">
    <text class="section-title">计算依据</text>
    <text>2θ=(2θ左+2θ右)/2，θ=(2θ左+2θ右)/4。按完整测次统计，不把左右游标当成两次独立测量。</text>
    <text>u_A(θ)=tₚ·s/√n。tₚ取谢超然《大学物理实验》(2015)表1.1.2；未列的n不自动插值。</text>
    <text>一级衍射λ=d·sinθ；独立项传播u²(λ)=(λ·u(d)/d)²+(d·cosθ)²·[u_A²(θ)+u_B²(θ)]。</text>
    <text>离开页面后记录不保留，请及时复制。</text>
  </view>
</view>
